'''Tears of Rot''' is a [[trigger]]ed [[spell]] granted by {{il|The Bane of Hope}}. 

__TOC__

==Skill functions and interactions==
While active, [[bow]] attacks against {{stl|Impale}}d enemies inflict Weeping Black, a stackable [[physical]] [[damage over time]] debuff that deals 625 base physical damage per second for 3 seconds, and can stack up to 5 times.

